  "question": {
    "text": "The curve having differential equation, <math><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> and passing through the origin, also passes through",
    "image": null
