  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation is <math><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Or <math><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Integrating, we get <math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Since, it passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
